</section></score></mdiv></body>
<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>And O what love is beaming</l><l>Refulgent in that face!</l><l>What blessed light is streaming</l><l>From that most glorious place!</l><l>Both love and light proclaiming</l><l>What Thou, the Father, art,</l><l>And wondrous grace revealing,</l><l>With Thine own Son, our part.</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>Thou source of every blessing!</l><l>Thou spring of all delight!</l><l>Thy Name with joy confessing</l><l>Let all the saints unite!</l><l>Each heart its praise outpouring</l><l>To Thee all praise above,</l><l>Each voice in strains adoring</l><l>Re-echoes—“God is love.”</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
